 # Changelog
 
+## v1.2.18 — Chat UX, smart project context and safe defaults
+
+- Add copy controls and visible date/time metadata to every Harness transcript message, with safe migration for legacy stored items.
+- Start opened/restored projects in Agent + Protected + Auto, while preserving the invariant that Unprotected cannot coexist with Auto.
+- Replace the ChatGPT helper strip with compact action cards for project context, current prompt and expected result; context/prompt can be copied or explicitly sent to the currently open ChatGPT conversation.
+- Track the last project-context SHA and ChatGPT conversation URL per Harness chat: attach a fresh context ZIP on the first turn, on a new concrete conversation URL, or after the project snapshot changes; omit duplicate ZIPs on unchanged sequential turns.
+- Treat an explicit Harness send while another concrete ChatGPT conversation is visibly open as an intentional rebind and refresh context without reading the remote DOM.
+- Prevent the project Rules inspector from crashing on legacy/null collection payloads and make backend context inspection serialize empty roots, entries and rule patterns as arrays.
+
